                            f"nearest {S.hits_of(answers[0])[:2]}")
E       AssertionError: the CPU address reports 'gpu', yet the search answered (available is True, no reason (None), 6 hits); nearest [('6ed39f6f20a6645c722a8a9f', 'notes/kiln.md', 0.056141726672649384), ('7e60fe9e8921c9ac62d2d213', 'notes/orchard.md', 1.0)]
E       assert not ['available is True', 'no reason (None)', '6 hits']

